able families are selected because this is a bounded single-thinker AOI synthesis task and each family contributes a distinct, non-redundant compositional layer: thematic_synthesis anchors the primary content, sin_findings supplies evidentiary detail, engagement_mapping provides the structural contrast pattern, and thematic_report closes the arc with integrated narrative framing. No family was extraneous to this workflow.\"}",
